CLKC-21#1 Advisory
MMCME3 with ZHOLD does not drive sequential IO  
The MMCME3 cell clk_wiz_0_inst/inst/mmcme3_adv_inst has COMPENSATION value ZHOLD, but CLKOUT0 output does not drive any sequential IO cells. It is recommended to use the MMCM without a feedback buffer and set COMPENSATION to INTERNAL.
Related violations: <none>


